      "reactions": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{643edcaa488fde18e402d5c4|full_name} The VCC has a huge problem with this because of lack of Admin Permissions. It only worked successfully in my tests when I launched VCC as Admin.\n\nA better suggestion for this is to make the Creator Companion ALWAYS request Administration Permissions in order to automate the installation process, regardless of computer.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
