  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-11-04T16:25:13.313Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm in a hotel with abysmal internet. As a power user, It would be nice to be able to get all of my tools and repos set up while this thing downloads. I have a lot of repos to add, so this takes a not-insignificant amount of time. \n\nThere is dead space in the bar on the left that would be perfect for adding a 'Download Progress' bar that switches back to the installer dialog.",
